  "review_notes": [
    "The former west living window bay is a solid wall in existing mushroom exterior and warm interior plaster, continuing to the sloping ceiling. Bathroom privacy glazing remains.",
    "The 48-inch electric concept is moved from the pocket wall to a six-foot limestone surround on the solid west wall; the former fireplace and surround are absent.",
    "Protected-model comparison against commit 8062ca6 confirms 326 pergola/door/pocket/facade/drain objects have identical geometry, transforms and materials at seven sampled frames.",
    "Nine affected native images were rendered at full 3200 x 2000 presentation settings and visually reviewed. Five retained views are outside the revised living wall: serving counter open/closed, front arrival, roof/parking and primary bath.",
    "The rebuilt native model reopens with 38 pinned library versions and 2720 gross enclosed square feet. All existing household provisions are retained.",
    "Twenty interior routes, 420 moving-panel/wall checks and 16800 panel/fireplace comparisons pass. The fireplace has 4.07 feet to the chaise and a clear three-foot front-removal reservation.",
    "IFC4 export passes schema validation with zero errors; actual Bonsai import reopens 798 meshes and compares 136 product meshes, including solid west wall and reoriented fireplace.",
    "The floor plan and measured roof section show the solid west wall and new fireplace position. All ten final booklet pages were rendered and visually reviewed; the site plan remains unchanged.",
    "Four Image Gen photographic studies derive from reviewed current native views: terrace hero, vault, kitchen-to-vault and dedicated fireplace. Actual prompts and hashes are registered; no full photographic tour is claimed.",
    "Coastal gallery, source hashes, README coverage and local document links were verified. No independent specialist-agent review is claimed."
  ],
  "limitations": "Architectural concept and editable visualization. Spans, member cores, connections, pergola ledger/footings, roof assemblies, wind/flood exposure, waterproofing, drainage capacity/outfall, corrosion, condensation, site conditions, selected-product operation, accessibility and jurisdiction approval remain unresolved. Slatted pergola provides shade, not rain protection. AI studies are not exact geometry evidence or photographs of a built house. The electric fireplace is a working concept assumption, with product, circuit, thermal and ventilation requirements unselected.",
